king more and expanding on our current game. ", "short_description": "This game is about a made-up species of monkeys, known as \"Mankeiz\"\nThe movement is a unique kind that is found in the game \"Gorilla Tag\" it makes the game more fun and makes it so you move more than with normal movement, we have a small amount of maps as of now, but we are looking forward to making more and expanding on our current game."}]}, "developer_name": "Mankeiz Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/mankeiz-official-web/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mankeiz Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/mankeiz-official-web/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7402361749861779"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031577_422267513892782_1257568971600549995_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EhCYWeoY1SwQ7kNvwHMSyq6&_nc_oc=AdrSvnKCNAnD9CcNMOJqf3b_rJXqNZvcrhz77FR2II3o4fIl8MEND7hwJfKV-V8f2SQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2jx_ediNWaVtfLIb3SYulot_sjGrb8e0Kpp4fDCc__dw&oe=69E63190"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Mankeiz", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context